        "$ax+by+cz+d=0$.　(3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样的方程的解集是一个无穷解集. 假定 $(x_1,y_1,z_1)$ 是",
        "它的一个解,于是有等式:",
        "$ax_1+by_1+cz_1+d=0$.　(4)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从方程(3)减去方程(4),得到与(3)等价的方程:",
        "$a(x-x_1)+b(y-y_1)+c(z-z_1)=0$　(5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但方程(5)是通过点 $M_1(x_1,y_1,z_1)$ 且与向量 $\\vec{n}=(a,b,c)$",
        "垂直的平面的方程,这样的平面是唯一的(§29). $\\blacksquare$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样,以下的定理成立:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理26. 所有的一次方程 $ax+by+cz+d=0$,在坐标",
        "空间中确定唯一的一个平面,而且这个平面与以 $(a,b,c)$ 为",
        "坐标的向量垂直."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "知道向量 $\\vec{n}=(a,b,c)$ 的坐标,可以解决关于平面 $ax+by",
        "+cz+d=0$ 与坐标轴的相关位置的问题. 例如,如果 $c\\ne0$,",
        "$a=b=0$,那么 $\\vec{n}=(0,0,c)$,即 $\\vec{n}=c\\vec{k}$. 因而方程 $cz+d=0$ 给",
        "出和 $z$ 轴垂直的平面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "23",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "23. 已知点 $A(3,2,5)$, $B(-1,-2,2)$, $C(7,0,-9)$,",
        "$D\\left(\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{5}{6},6\\right)$. 指出它们中哪些属于平面 $2x-3y+z-5=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "24",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "24. 求作下列平面与坐标平面的交线:1) $2x+3y-z-6",
        "=0$; 2) $3x-4y+2z-12=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "25",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "25. 如果已知点 $N(3,5,2)$ 是过坐标原点到一个平面的",
        "垂线的垂足. 求这个平面的方程."
      ]
    },
